      "text": "Frequency once per minute\n\nRequirements Ryhasphinea is adjacent to an undead creature\n\n---\nEffect Ryhasphinea siphons void energy into the undead creature, granting it 30 temporary Hit Points and making it Quickened for 3 rounds. The undead creature's temporary Hit Points last as long as it remains quickened, and it can use the extra action only to Stride or Strike.",
