      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "disease",
        "divine",
        "unholy",
        "virulent"
      ],
      "text": "Saving Throw DC 33 Fortitude save\n\nStage 1 carrier (1 day)\n\nStage 2 3d8 void damage and Drained 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 3 4d8 void damage, drained 1, and Enfeebled 2 (1 day)\n\nStage 4 4d8 void damage, drained 1, enfeebled 2, and Clumsy 3 (1 day)\n\nStage 5 4d8 void damage, Drained 2, Enfeebled 3, clumsy 3, and Doomed 3\n\nStage 6 dead. A creature that dies while infected with soulphage rises as a War Wraith"
    },
