      "text": "Ryhasphinea makes a scything blade Strike and compares the attack roll result to the AC of up to two foes, each of whom must be within her melee reach. Roll damage only once, and apply it to each creature hit. The first creature damaged by Visceral Reap also takes 1d6 persistent,bleed damage. Reap counts as two attacks for Ryhasphinea's multiple attack penalty."
